                    132.0,
                    603.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. If an Employee is on scheduled leave and called back to work, a corrected OPM 71 Leave Request Form will be submitted to the Timekeeper upon the Employee reporting to work.",
            "block_bbox": [
                131,
                629,
                1073,
                715
